flowchart TD
    A[User opens Nexus frontend] --> B[Socket.IO client]
    B --> C[Connect to API server]
    C --> D[Socket connection established]
    D --> E[Client sends organization:join]
    E --> F[Backend reads JWT token]
    F --> G{Valid token?}
    G -->|No| H[organization:error]
    G -->|Yes| I[Verify organization membership]
    I --> J{Is member?}
    J -->|No| H
    J -->|Yes| K[Join organization room]
    K --> L[Client receives issue updates]

    M[User updates an issue] --> N[Backend updates PostgreSQL]
    N --> O[Backend emits issue:updated]
    O --> P[Broadcast to organization room]
    P --> L
    L --> Q[Frontend updates issue interface]

    D --> R[Client disconnects]
    R --> S[Backend logs disconnection]